---
source: crates/biome_css_parser/tests/spec_test.rs
expression: snapshot
---

## Input

```css
.a {
  color: if(sass(true) red; else: blue);
  width: 1px;
}
.after-modern { height: 2px; }
.b {
  color: if(style((--x: 1)), red;
  width: 3px;
}
.after-legacy { height: 4px; }

.missing-colon {
  color: if(style(--enabled: true) red; else: blue);
  width: 1px;
}
.missing-colon-comma { color: if(style(--enabled: true) red, blue); width: 1px; }
.missing-colon-end { color: if(style(--enabled: true) red); width: 1px; }
.missing-operand {
  color: if(not : red; else: blue);
  width: 1px;
}
$x: red;
.interpolation {
  color: if(style((--x: if(sass(true): "#{$x +}"; else: blue))): green; else: black);
  width: 1px;
}
.after { height: 2px; }

```


